# The repo holds the site itself. Kept out: system and editor files, local tooling and design notes,
# and the owner's full-size source pictures (the site serves the smaller copies made from them).

# system
.DS_Store
node_modules/
.wrangler/
.dev.vars*

# local tooling and design notes (DEPLOY.md stays)
